Dictionary data
===============

The CC-CEDICT snapshot in `source/cedict_ts.u8`, the translations in
`translations/` and the term dictionary built from them (cedict-ko.zip) are
derived from CC-CEDICT and are licensed under the Creative Commons
Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International License (CC BY-SA 4.0):
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/

CC-CEDICT is published by MDBG (https://www.mdbg.net/) and maintained by its
contributors (https://cc-cedict.org/). It is based on CEDICT,
Copyright (C) 1997, 1998 Paul Andrew Denisowski.

The Korean 훈음 in `translations/hanzi.jsonl` and the character dictionary
built from them (hanzi-ko.zip) are licensed under CC BY-SA 4.0 as well.

The character list in `source/hanzi.jsonl` (readings, definitions, variants,
stroke counts, 通用规范汉字表 numbers) and the same fields in hanzi-ko.zip are
taken from the Unicode Han Database (Unihan), which is distributed under the
Unicode License V3 reproduced below.

